{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>My voice</b> — the meaning is: I will not engage in battle, but I will raise my voice in prayer." "<b>His holy mountain</b> — on account of the ark that was in Zion, it is called the mountain of holiness. And this was before the matter of Araunah the Jebusite."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:11.514806102Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}